       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CALLERCORRELATION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 FLAG PIC X.
       01 LOOP-FLAG PIC 9 VALUE 0.
       01 TARGET PIC X(8).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN.
       MOVE '0' TO FLAG.
       PERFORM BODY.
       CALL TARGET.
       MOVE '1' TO FLAG.
       PERFORM BODY.
       GOBACK.
       BODY.
       IF FLAG = '0'
       MOVE 'ONLY' TO TARGET
       ELSE
       MOVE 'UNOBS' TO TARGET
       END-IF.
       IF LOOP-FLAG = 1 GO TO BODY END-IF.
       EXIT.
